// --- H. Trailing P/E vs same-category stocks (本益比) ---
// Pine cannot list every symbol in an industry. The basket is the largest US primary
// common stocks over $1B in the same TradingView industry, or the same sector when
// that industry has fewer than two listed names. Membership snapshot: 2026-10-13.
// The multiple is live: daily close / trailing twelve-month EPS.
